  "description": "With the Legion Series, Mongoose offers a full line of freestyle BMX bikes for riders of all ages and ability levels. The Legion LXS is the perfect sidewalk cruiser for young riders looking for their first 20” BMX-style bike.\nHi-Ten steel frame, fork, and handbars (7\")\n152 mm 1-piece crank with a 36T steel chainring and American loose ball bottom bracket.\n20” x 2.0” tires mounted on aluminum single wall 36H rims with 3/8” female axle front hub and 16T cog freewheel cassette rear hub.\n36 mm stem, threaded headset, and steel linear pull brakes.\n18.2-inch top tube length. Suggested rider height is 4’0” - 5’0”.",
